# inc-r6u1: Searing Light against an UNDEAD target at the game's maximum
# reachable effective caster level (Priest 11, ChallengeRating 11). The mummy
# carries M_UNDEAD (lib/mon3.irh), so CalcEffect picks the `tval: MA_UNDEAD`
# branch -- `(LEVEL_SCALED)d6`, which the Desc caps at 10d6 (1d6/level).
#
# LEVEL_SCALED at 11 is 9 + (11-9)/3 = 9, so the unfixed game rolls 9d6 where
# the Desc promises 10d6. The fix (LEVEL_MAX10 = min(10,level)) makes it 10d6.
# This is the observable half of the defect at the reachable level cap.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_RUN_DIR="$PWD/logs/inc-r6u1/undead" \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/searing-light-undead.keys 1
@include searing-light-cl11-setup.keys
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Corporeal Undead"
@choose "mummy"
RIGHT
ENTER
@dump:undead-summoned
m
@choose "Searing Light"
RIGHT
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:undead-after-cast
v
@dump:undead-messages
@while "Messages" ESC
@quit
